      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEASIDER (3) was last seen when fourth to Captain Mistress in the Rising Sun four months ago, a solid end to a successful campaign highlighted by wins in the Riverina Championship and the state final of the Regional Championships, the latter at this venue. Yet to miss a place when fresh and was readied with a trial win. The good draw gives him the chance for a winning return. JUNGLE DRAGON (5) has been close to the placings in Listed FFA races in his last two outings, coming from very wide to be beaten less than 5m last week. Draws lower and is well placed. Big threat. The ace draw brings DANCE WITH CARMER (1) right into contention having won at Newcastle the last time he started on the pegs three back. FOREVER ONTHE PUNT (2) tackles a stronger bunch tonight but draws well and must be respected after winning his two outings here since joining Brad Hewitt.",
